        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Hunt Prey"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nThe slave lord designates as its prey a single creature that they can see or hear or that they are Tracking. They gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks when they Seek their prey and a +2 circumstance bonus to Survival checks when they track their prey. They also ignore the penalty for making ranged attacks within their second range increment against their prey.\n\nThe first time a slave lord hits their hunted prey in a round, they deal 2d8 additional precision damage. A slave lord can have only one prey designated at a time."
            },
